{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p046a","title":"曹操募民屯田许下","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p046a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》记曹操在许下募民屯田，得谷百万斛，随后州郡置田官积粮。","evidence":["wudi-e-p046a-q"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ae4d8b1049c4f75960ca","label":"正文","text":"太祖任任峻为典农中郎将","evidence":["rensu-q-2577e6138d8460ef1708"]},{"id":"rensu-a-62b6536e6a1db2dd92dd","label":"正文","text":"任峻募百姓屯田于许下得谷百万斛，郡国列置田官，数年中仓廪皆满","evidence":["rensu-q-f154817d23b9d557195a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"推行屯田","evidence":["wudi-e-p046a-q"]},{"person":"rensu-p0006","role":"受任典农中郎将者；主持屯田者","evidence":["rensu-q-2577e6138d8460ef1708","rensu-q-f154817d23b9d557195a"]}],"place":{"text":"许下","evidence":["wudi-e-p046a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安元年","year":196,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p046a-q","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"],"chronology":"wudi-y196","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o040","basis":"建安元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,297,"P046a"],"order":132}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"rensu-p0006","name":"任峻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-2577e6138d8460ef1708","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖以峻为典农中郎将","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f154817d23b9d557195a","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"募百姓屯田于许下〖5〗，得谷百万斛；郡国列置田官。〕数年中，所在积粟，仓廪皆满","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p046a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-600f0712576696865299","layer":"pei","quote":"是岁，乃募民屯田许下，得谷百万斛。于是州郡例置田官，所在积谷；","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-50452beeb3e13bec2fd1","start":137,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
